			"hadithnumber": 1603,
			"arabicnumber": 1603,
			"text": "Narrated Ibn 'Umar: That the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"Indeed when a Jew gives Salam to one of you, then he is only saying: 'As-Samu 'Alaikum' (Death be upon you) so say: \"Alaik (And upon you).'\" [Abu 'Eisa said:] This Hadith is Hasan Sahih",
